      "$note": "The canonical transaction lifecycle (doc 07 §4). These 13 names are the stable API: the same string identifies a state in the UI, the token set, the event stream and the copy deck. tools/audit-states.py enforces that every one of them has a colour, a tint, a badge, an icon and both labels.",
